            <t index="291" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:43,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:46,860</end-time>
                <translation>是那时的律师、医生</translation>
                <original>なってきたのは、弁護士だと医者だとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="292" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:46,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:49,690</end-time>
                <translation>学校的老师 还有大学教授等等
あの学校の老师とか、まあ大学教授とか</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="293" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:49,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:53,660</end-time>
                <translation>在这些领域里 犹太人的比例非常高</translation>
                <original>そういうものにで、そのユダヤ人のはものすごく高いんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="294" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:53,670</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:57,440</end-time>
                <translation>他们躲在暗处 似乎勾结在一起</translation>
                <original>こう影に隠れて、どうもなんかこう結託して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="295" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:57,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:01,420</end-time>
                <translation>在欧洲各国不断向上爬</translation>
                <original>なんかヨーロッパ各国で、あのどんどん上り詰めてんじゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
