            <t index="296" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:01,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:04,660</end-time>
                <translation>这种感受很容易在人们心中膨胀</translation>
                <original>なんかそういうイメージが、なんかこう膨らみやすい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="297" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:04,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:06,550</end-time>
                <translation>这种状况是确实存在的</translation>
                <original>状況はあったわね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="298" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:06,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:08,330</end-time>
                <translation>恐怕他们之中</translation>
                <original>おそらく自分は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="299" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:08,330</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:10,600</end-time>
                <translation>自己与这群犹太人都是德国人</translation>
                <original>ドイツ人なのにうまくいかない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="300" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:10,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:12,620</end-time>
                <translation>为什么自己过的这么不好 有很多人那时这么想</translation>
                <original>という人は一杯いるわけで、その時に</original>
