                <end-time>00:18:17,680</end-time>
                <translation>更不用说 如果在被煽动了 那就是</translation>
                <original>まして、ここは煽られたりとかすると、それは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="303" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:17,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:19,460</end-time>
                <translation>会变成之后的样子呢</translation>
                <original>そこに行きますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="304" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:19,590</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:20,740</end-time>
                <translation>特别是 现在也是如此</translation>
                <original>特にまあ、今でもそう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="305" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:20,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:23,740</end-time>
                <translation>我们发现记者很多都是犹太人后</translation>
                <original>ジャーナリストとかが、もうユダヤ人が占めているとなると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="306" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:23,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:26,650</end-time>
                <translation>-那就很容易陷入妄想呢 -原来如此</translation>
                <original>ちょっと妄想働きやすいですよね -なるほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="307" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:26,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:31,890</end-time>
                <translation>在这种情况下发生了象征反犹主义的事件</translation>
                <original>そんな中 反ユダヤ主義を象徴するような事件が起こります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="308" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:37,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:41,010</end-time>
                <translation>1894年 法国陆军军官阿尔弗雷德·德雷福斯</translation>
                <original>1894年フランス陸軍隊アルフレドドレフュスが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="309" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:41,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:44,810</end-time>
                <translation>因被怀疑是德国间谍而被逮捕</translation>
                <original>ドイツのスパイである容疑をかけられ逮捕されます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="310" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:46,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:50,220</end-time>
                <translation>记载着法国陆军机密信息的便条</translation>
                <original>フランス陸軍の機密情報が記されたメモが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="311" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:50,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:53,660</end-time>
                <translation>在德国外交官的宅邸被发现
ドイツの外交官の屋敷から発見され</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="312" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:53,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:57,750</end-time>
                <translation>由于笔迹相似 德雷福斯便受到了怀疑</translation>
                <original>筆跡が似ていることからドレフュスが疑われたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="313" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:00,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:02,190</end-time>
                <translation>德雷福斯主张自己无罪</translation>
                <original>ドレフュスは無罪を主張</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="314" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:02,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:05,860</end-time>
                <translation>物证和间接证据都很薄弱
物的証拠も状況証拠も薄弱でした</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="315" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:06,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:07,970</end-time>
                <translation>逮捕的理由是</translation>
                <original>逮捕の理由は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="316" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:08,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:12,230</end-time>
                <translation>他是唯一的犹太裔军官</translation>
                <original>彼がただ1人のユダヤ人士官であったこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="317" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:14,070</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:16,710</end-time>
                <translation>当时 反犹报纸</translation>
                <original>この時、反ユダヤ系の新聞は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="318" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:17,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:21,590</end-time>
                <translation>声称犹太人正在策划背叛国家的阴谋</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人は国家を裏切る陰謀を巡らせていると主張</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="319" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:22,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:24,410</end-time>
                <translation>也指责军方的软弱
軍部の弱腰も避難します</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="320" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:26,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:28,440</end-time>
                <translation>在证据不足的情况下</translation>
                <original>証拠不10分のまま</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="321" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:28,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:30,940</end-time>
                <translation>德雷福斯被判处终身监禁</translation>
                <original>ドレフュスの判決は終身刑</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="322" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:31,910</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:34,240</end-time>
                <translation>在练兵场上军刀被折断
練兵場で軍刀をへし折られ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="323" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:34,670</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:37,240</end-time>
                <translation>被送往南美的孤岛</translation>
                <original>南米の離島へと送られたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="324" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:40,090</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:42,790</end-time>
                <translation>阿伦特通过这一事件</translation>
                <original>アーレントは、この事件を通じ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="325" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:42,790</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:46,160</end-time>
                <translation>将试图同化入国民国家的犹太人</translation>
                <original>国民国家に同化しようとした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="326" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:46,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:49,250</end-time>
                <translation>用“Pariah”一词来形容</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人をパリアという言葉で表現</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="327" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:49,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:55,020</end-time>
                <translation>词义“被置于体制之外 不被当人对待的人”</translation>
                <original>それは体制外におかれ 人間扱いされない人を意味する言葉でした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="328" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:57,530</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:03,080</end-time>
                <translation>不幸的德雷福斯上尉的事件中没有人权</translation>
                <original>不幸なドレフュス大尉の事件は 人権などなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="329" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:03,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:07,360</end-time>
                <translation>社会一直试图将其置于法律保护之外的</translation>
                <original>社会が法の保護の外に置いておこうとしてきた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="330" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:07,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:10,320</end-time>
                <translation>那种Pariah的余响</translation>
                <original>あのパリアの名残が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="331" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:10,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:13,100</end-time>
                <translation>至今仍然潜藏在所有犹太男爵</translation>
                <original>全てのユダヤ人の男爵</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="332" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:13,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:15,450</end-time>
                <translation>所有犹太富豪</translation>
                <original>すべてのユダヤ人富豪</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="333" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:15,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:21,750</end-time>
                <translation>所有犹太民族主义者心中</translation>
                <original>すべてのユダヤ人のナショナリストの中に今なお潜んでいることを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="334" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:21,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:23,990</end-time>
                <translation>该事件向全世界证明了这一点</translation>
                <original>全世界に証明してしまった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="335" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:26,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:28,390</end-time>
                <translation>所谓犹太男爵中</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人の男爵っていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="336" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:28,670</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:31,690</end-time>
                <translation>尤其是银行家出身的人通过金钱</translation>
                <original>特にあの銀行家などお金で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="337" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:31,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:36,260</end-time>
                <translation>以购买的方式获得男爵称号的情况相当多</translation>
                <original>買うような形で、その男爵の称号を持っていることって結構あったんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="338" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:36,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:38,120</end-time>
                <translation>这里的犹太民族主义者</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人のナショナリストっていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="339" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:38,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:40,510</end-time>
                <translation>是指对法国、德国等</translation>
                <original>フランスだとか、そのドイツだとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="340" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:40,510</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:46,830</end-time>
                <translation>对他们各自所属的那个民族、国家怀有忠诚</translation>
                <original>それぞれのまあ一応属しているところのあのネーション ステートに対する忠誠を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="341" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:46,910</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:49,740</end-time>
                <translation>在这个意义上的民族主义者</translation>
                <original>持っているという意味でのナショナリストなんですけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="342" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:49,770</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:53,210</end-time>
                <translation>自己已经是男爵 已经是归属者了</translation>
                <original>自分はもう男爵で、もう帰属だし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="343" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:53,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:57,330</end-time>
                <translation>而且作为民族主义者 自己如此热爱法国</translation>
                <original>で、あのナショナリストとして、まあ、これだけそのフランスとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="344" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:57,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:58,800</end-time>
                <translation>如此热爱德国</translation>
                <original>ドイツ愛してんだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="345" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:58,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:03,360</end-time>
                <translation>本以为这样就不会再受到歧视了</translation>
                <original>もうこれでそんな差別をされるはずがないだろうと思ってたのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="346" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:03,410</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:06,660</end-time>
                <translation>实际上 以德雷福斯事件为契机</translation>
                <original>実は、このドレフュス事件をきっかけに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="347" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:06,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:09,390</end-time>
                <translation>你是犹太人所以才会做出这种事吧</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人だからお前こういうことやってるんだろうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="348" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:09,390</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:12,900</end-time>
                <translation>这让他们之前所建立的一切都变得毫无意义了</translation>
                <original>それまでこう築いてきたものはもう何の関係もなくなってしまうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="349" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:13,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:16,790</end-time>
                <translation>就在德雷福斯事件前不久</translation>
                <original>このドレフュス事件のあの直前ぐらいに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="350" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:17,210</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:21,320</end-time>
                <translation>在法国发生了巴拿马运河贿赂丑闻</translation>
                <original>あのフランスでそのパナマの運河疑獄っていうのがあるんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="351" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:21,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:24,540</end-time>
                <translation>犹太资本有出钱参与</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ資本がなんかかねだしてて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="352" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:24,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:27,740</end-time>
                <translation>就会让大众觉得他们是不是故意这么干的</translation>
                <original>どうもあいつらがなんかこうわざとやったんじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="353" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:27,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:30,220</end-time>
                <translation>刚好是这是发生的时期</translation>
                <original>っていうことを産まれた時期に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="354" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:30,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:32,400</end-time>
                <translation>人们此前已经是愤怒的了</translation>
                <original>もうこれ、怒ったもんだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="355" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:32,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:34,020</end-time>
                <translation>会觉得果然又是犹太人</translation>
                <original>あ、やっぱりユダヤ人は後</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="356" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:35,290</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:36,980</end-time>
                <translation>这样 所以</translation>
                <original>でこれだからなんかこう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="357" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:37,010</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:41,480</end-time>
                <translation>与其说是某个煽动家有计划地制造出来的</translation>
                <original>どっかの扇動家がなんかこう計画的に作ったというよりは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="358" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:41,510</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:44,430</end-time>
                <translation>不如说是国民已经对那种东西</translation>
                <original>もうなんかその国民がそういうものを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="359" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:44,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:48,250</end-time>
                <translation>深信不疑 情绪高涨起来</translation>
                <original>あの信じてぐっとこう盛り上がってしまうような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="360" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:48,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:51,080</end-time>
                <translation>这种基础材料其实早就存在</translation>
                <original>もう素地がすぐにあったんだということが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="361" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:51,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:53,730</end-time>
                <translation>才是这件事的关键所在
この話のまあ味噌なんだ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="362" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:53,730</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:55,860</end-time>
                <translation>听到了很好的解释 或者是阴谋论</translation>
                <original>うまい言い方かな陰謀論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="363" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:55,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:58,220</end-time>
                <translation>再加上自己的想象 觉得有某种可能</translation>
                <original>自分ならこうなんじゃないかこういう可能性もあるよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="364" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:58,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:01,170</end-time>
                <translation>当各种线索一下子拼合起来的时候</translation>
                <original>っていうパーツががっとこうはまった時の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="365" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:01,170</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:03,020</end-time>
                <translation>那种很痛快的感觉</translation>
                <original>ある意味の気持ちよさ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="366" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:03,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:06,290</end-time>
                <translation>真相是这样啊！</translation>
                <original>そうだったんだって思った</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="367" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:06,290</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:07,460</end-time>
                <translation>从那以后</translation>
                <original>そこから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="368" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:08,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:10,130</end-time>
                <translation>大家就很难不遵从那种解释了吧</translation>
                <original>みんな離れられなくなりますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="369" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:10,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:13,290</end-time>
                <translation>再加上您最初提到的闭塞感的状况中</translation>
                <original>最初におっしゃった閉塞感みたいな状況の中で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="370" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:14,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:16,570</end-time>
                <translation>会使它猛烈加速吧 阴谋论</translation>
                <original>猛烈加速しますよね 陰謀論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="371" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:16,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:20,460</end-time>
                <translation>果然 在经济陷入困境的时候</translation>
                <original>まあ、やっぱりあの経済的にやっぱりこう行き詰った時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="372" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:20,490</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:24,390</end-time>
                <translation>就会想 是不是有什么人在拖后腿呢</translation>
                <original>これやっぱりなんかは足引っ張ってるやつがいるんじゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="373" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:24,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:25,540</end-time>
                <translation>不仅仅是将其视作异物</translation>
                <original>単に異物じゃなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="374" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:25,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:29,430</end-time>
                <translation>甚至是那个异物把他们的潜力</translation>
                <original>その異物が自分たちのそのポテンシャルを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="375" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:29,430</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:31,240</end-time>
                <translation>全都夺走了</translation>
                <original>まあ、あの奪っていると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="376" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:31,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,010</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来 就会逐渐形成“这个异物是必须排除的东西”的想法</translation>
                <original>そうするとこの異物は覗かないといけない物だっていう発想にこうなっていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="377" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:36,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:37,270</end-time>
                <translation>是敌人了呢</translation>
                <original>敵ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="378" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:37,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:38,170</end-time>
                <translation>是敌人呢</translation>
                <original>敵ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="379" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:39,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:41,910</end-time>
                <translation>不仅仅是讨厌的家伙 而是敌人</translation>
                <original>単に嫌な奴じゃなくててきなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="380" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:41,910</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:46,650</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此 如果不排除 就会给自己带来损害</translation>
                <original>なるほど排除しなければ自分たちにそうを与えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="381" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:46,770</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:50,210</end-time>
                <translation>一旦这样的回路形成之后</translation>
                <original>やっぱりそういうような回路が一旦出来上がってしまうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="382" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:50,530</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,080</end-time>
                <translation>果然就会把它</translation>
                <original>やっぱりそれを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="383" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:52,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:55,640</end-time>
                <translation>一旦同样的想法再次出现</translation>
                <original>そういう発想をやっぱ同じようなことが起こると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="384" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:55,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:58,500</end-time>
                <translation>下一次就会以更大的规模再次重现</translation>
                <original>今度はそれはもっと、大きな規模でまた再現すると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="385" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:58,710</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:03,160</end-time>
                <translation>想要排除与自己不同的人的这种情绪和动向</translation>
                <original>自分たちとはその異なる人たちを排除したいっていう気持ちとか動きっていうのは本当</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="386" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:03,170</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,410</end-time>
                <translation>在当今的现代 世界各地也都能看到吧</translation>
                <original>に今の現代でも世界各地にみられますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="387" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:06,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:08,830</end-time>
                <translation>社会的大多数人</translation>
                <original>社会の大多数は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="388" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:09,010</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,480</end-time>
                <translation>果然还是会倾向于支持那些会让自己产生共鸣的人</translation>
                <original>やっぱりこう自分に対して共感してくれるような人たち</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="389" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:13,490</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:16,830</end-time>
                <translation>然后 把对自己来说的敌人？</translation>
                <original>で、自分にとっててきっていうのを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="390" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:17,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,990</end-time>
                <translation>该怎么说呢</translation>
                <original>何て言うかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="391" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:18,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,930</end-time>
                <translation>就是那极少数的</translation>
                <original>あのごく少数のあの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="392" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:21,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,070</end-time>
                <translation>归结到某个特殊群体 以这种方式去思考</translation>
                <original>特殊なグループに、なんかまとめて考えていくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="393" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:25,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:28,010</end-time>
                <translation>那就会让人很安心吧</translation>
                <original>まあ大体こう 気持ちが落ち着いてきますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="394" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:30,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:33,290</end-time>
                <translation>反过来要面对它 真的需要</translation>
                <original>立ち向かうのをちょっと本当にあの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="395" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:34,630</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:36,500</end-time>
                <translation>我们打起精神去努力</translation>
                <original>気合を入れて頑張るんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="396" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:36,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:40,210</end-time>
                <translation>好 下回我们将更进一步阅读</translation>
                <original>さあ、次回またさらに読み進めていきたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="397" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:40,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:42,030</end-time>
                <translation>仲正老师 今天非常感谢</translation>
